      "text": "More About Alicia"
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "With a deep passion for recovery and mental health care, Alicia Joslin brings empathy, leadership, and dedication to her role as Program Director at Marina Harbor Detox. She works closely with both clients and staff to foster an environment centered on accountability, compassion, and personal growth."
    },
    {
      "tag": "p",
      "text": "Alicia understands that recovery is not one-size-fits-all and believes every client deserves individualized support and encouragement throughout their treatment journey. Her goal is to help clients feel supported during some of the most difficult moments of their lives while empowering them to move toward lasting recovery and stability."
    }
  ],
